      <h1>Trading signals and copy trading</h1>
      <div class="text">
        <p>Copy other traders' deals straight from your platform. There are thousands of signals with different trading characteristics to choose from. After subscribing to a signal, all deals of a signal provider are automatically repeated on your trading account.
        </p>
        <h2>Trading signals advantages:</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Over 10,000 signals for copying — choose a signal that suits you best.</li>
          <li>You have access to the entire trading history for each signal in order to make informed decisions. You can see all successes and failures of the trader.</li>
          <li>Explore signals' in-depth analytics to select offers with specific risk and profitability parameters.<br></li>
          <li>Fixed subscription price — no spreads or hidden fees.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>Select a suitable signal&nbsp;and copy other traders' deals!</p>
